msgid "We have already been notified and are working on it."
msgstr "Siamo già stati avvisati e ce ne stiamo occupando."

#: paperplane-mail-test.php:1000
msgid "We will send you another email as soon as the problem is solved."
msgstr "Ti invieremo un'altra email appena il problema sarà risolto."

